hareruya-design-docs/excel_to_html/output/0212_基本設計仕様書(デッキ管理).html:2208:                <tr id="item-sheet-5-13"><td><a class="item-no" href="#pin-sheet-5-13"><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0212" data-excel-sheet="デッキ編集" data-excel-ref="0212:デッキ編集!B143" data-excel-formula="=ROW() - ROW($B$131) + 1">13</span></a></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0212" data-excel-sheet="デッキ編集" data-excel-ref="0212:デッキ編集!E143">プレイヤー名</span></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0212" data-excel-sheet="デッキ編集" data-excel-ref="0212:デッキ編集!M143">文字列</span></td><td></td><td><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0212" data-excel-sheet="デッキ編集" data-excel-ref="0212:デッキ編集!V143">64文字</span></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
